# Agent context discipline (token cost)

This repo’s disk weight is mostly `data/`, `artifacts/`, `.venv/`, and `.git` — not source.
Those paths are excluded by `.cursorignore` / `.clineignore`. Do **not** try to “discover” them.

## Open first (in order)
1. `docs/EXECUTION_BACKLOG.md` — master work queue (PAST / PRESENT / FORWARD / DEFERRED)
2. `docs/reference/repo_canonical_map.md` — what is canonical vs archive
3. `AGENTS.md` — pointer table only

## Prefer reading
- `production/` ops + odds scripts
- `src/Python/` libraries
- `docs/reference/` and `docs/paper/` markdown
- Dated evidence under `docs/reference/reports/` when cited by the backlog

## Do not
- Glob or summarize parquet / Savant / Artifacts / model binaries
- Re-explore the whole tree each session
- Invent a parallel backlog or “next session” doc

